      "publisher": "arXiv",
      "abstract": "We develop a new formulation of deep learning based on the Mori-Zwanzig (MZ) formalism of irreversible statistical mechanics. The new formulation is built upon the well-known duality between deep neural networks and discrete stochastic dynamical systems, and it allows us to directly propagate quanti...",
      "year": 2022,
