          "snippet": "A DMD-based approach that involves a Moore-Penrose pseudo-inverse for approximating the finite Koopman operator has also been tested with these neural network-based dictionaries [18]. Pan et al [19] proposed a probabilistic Koopman learning framework based on Bayesian neural networks for continuous dynamical systems while offering a stability constraint on their Koopman parametrization.",
