          "targetDoi": "10.1007/s11071-005-2824-x",
          "snippet": "Figure 3 (top-left) illustrates the RMSE of the predicted trajectories within the limit cycle, comparing different models as the number of observables (r) increases, for r ∈ [2,8,16]. For DMD, Figure 3.",
          "section": "(i) case i: limit cycle",
          "type": "mentioning"
